        "original_id": "f4ce853e-5b2e-5614-8425-3622dfa332cf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Wyse, Jessica Stroup, Matt Long\n- Products: Iron Fist, The Bold and the Beautiful, Spring Awakening, The Defenders, 90210, The Following, Homecoming\n- Concepts: Marvel Cinematic Universe, Deaf West Broadway revival\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Stroup was born on October 23, 1986, and she is an American actress.\n- In 2009, the film Homecoming followed a student couple, Mike played by Matt Long and Elizabeth played by Jessica Stroup, on their homecoming.\n- In 2015, Alex Wyse played Georg Zirschnitz in the Deaf West Broadway revival of Spring Awakening.\n- Alex Wyse is best known for playing Kyle in Iron Fist and Saul Feinberg in The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Iron Fist is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Iron Fist was the fourth in a series of shows that led to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- Jessica Stroup is best known for playing Erin Silver on 90210, Max Hardy on The Following, and Joy Meachum in Iron Fist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
